<!doctype html><html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><head><meta name="theme-color" content="#004ba0" data-rh="true"/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json"/><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer-when-downgrade"><title>MIRKIT - A tool that enhances your MIR4 gaming experience.</title><meta data-rh="true" name="description" content="Mirkit is the ultimate MIR4 companion tool. Track player rankings, power scores, server transfers, crafting materials, dragon artifacts, game maps, event timers, and in-game market prices."/><meta data-rh="true" name="keywords" content="MIR4, MIR, mir4 tracker, mir4 nft, mir4 tracking, mir4 stats, mir4 score, mir4 level, mir4 server, mir4 rank, mir4 ranking, mir4 leaderboard, mirkit, mir4 crafting materials, mir4 calculator, mir4 craft, mir4 materials, mir4 maps, mir4 guide, mir4 timing, mir4 timer, mir4 market, mir4 in-game market, mir4 dragon artifact, mir4 constitution, mir4 clan ranking, mir4 server transfer, mir4 power score"/><meta name="author" content="Mirkit"/><meta data-rh="true" name="robots" content="index, follow"/><link data-rh="true" rel="canonical" href="https://mirkit.mir4collection.com"/><script type="text/llms.txt"># Mirkit - MIR4 Game Tracker

> The ultimate MIR4 companion tool - track players, rankings, server transfers, and more.

Mirkit is a free web-based toolkit for the MMORPG game MIR4 by Wemade, actively maintained since 2022. It serves thousands of players worldwide with player power score tracking, server/clan rankings, server transfers, in-game market prices, crafting calculators, constitution tools, dragon artifact guides, interactive maps, and an AI-powered game assistant. Supports 7 languages.

## Key Features
- Player & Clan Rankings - real-time power score tracking across all servers
- Server Transfer History - monitor player movements between servers
- Crafting Calculator - material requirements and cost optimization
- Constitution Calculator - stat optimization tool
- Dragon Artifact Guide - artifact combinations and effects
- Interactive Game Maps - resource locations and points of interest
- Event Timers - in-game event schedules and countdowns
- Market Price Tracking - in-game marketplace analytics
- AI Chat Assistant - gameplay queries answered with AI (10 free/day, 40 premium/day)

## Premium ($9/month)
Full data history, daily transfer notifications, advanced market analytics, extended AI chat.

